  {
    "id": "ad1a7b9c-2da6-5d43-9c64-323f59408ece",
    "pack": "core-rulebook",
    "kind": "weapon",
    "slug": "weapon:holy-avenger",
    "name": "Holy Avenger",
    "level": 14,
    "rarity": "uncommon",
    "traits": ["divine", "good", "lawful", "versatile-p"],
    "sources": [
      {
        "kind": "book",
        "book": "core-rulebook",
        "aon": "https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=389"
      }
    ],
    "description": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "The gleaming holy avenger is the iconic weapon of powerful paladins. The crossbar of this +2 greater striking "
          },
          {
            "type": "ref",
            "id": "1c942139-39ff-5ab6-bccc-88a68a1ec2e6"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " cold iron longsword is styled to look like angel wings. Tradition holds that those who see their reflection in a holy avenger's highly polished blade have their faults laid bare. If you are evil, you are "
          },
          {
            "type": "ref",
            "id": "5aa15fa8-99a7-56a4-8237-f605177275dd",
            "label": "Enfeebled 2"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " while carrying or wielding this weapon."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "rule"
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Activate",
            "marks": ["strong"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " "
          },
          {
            "type": "action-cost",
            "cost": "two"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " command, Interact"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Frequency",
            "marks": ["strong"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " once per hour"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "rule"
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Effect",
            "marks": ["strong"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " You command the sword and point it at a creature you can see. The sword casts Detect Alignment to detect evil, but this targets only the selected creature instead of detecting in an area."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "rule"
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Paladin Wielder",
            "marks": ["strong"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " If you're a champion of the paladin cause, you also gain the following two benefits."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "list",
        "ordered": false,
        "items": [
          [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "When you critically hit an evil creature with the "
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "holy avenger",
                  "marks": ["emphasis"]
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": ", the creature is slowed 1 and enfeebled 2 for 1 round."
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
          [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "You can activate the sword in the following way."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Activate",
            "marks": ["strong"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " "
          },
          {
            "type": "action-cost",
            "cost": "one"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " command"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Frequency",
            "marks": ["strong"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " once per day"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Requirements",
            "marks": ["strong"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " You hit a creature using the "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "holy avenger",
            "marks": ["emphasis"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " on your previous action"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "rule"
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Effect",
            "marks": ["strong"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " You cast "
          },
          {
            "type": "ref",
            "id": "b434b2d9-47e5-519e-a542-6dae12c51157"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " at the same level as your champion focus spells. It must target an illusion the creature you hit created, a spell affecting the creature you hit, or an item the creature you hit wears or carries. The spell or item you attempt to counteract must be within 120 feet of you."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "rule"
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Craft Requirements",
            "marks": ["strong"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " You are a champion with the paladin cause; supply a casting of "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "detect alignment",
            "marks": ["emphasis"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " and "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "dispel magic",
            "marks": ["emphasis"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": ". The initial raw materials must include 120 gp of cold iron."
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "rules": [],
    "externalIds": {
      "foundry": "Compendium.pf2e.equipment-srd.Item.OIs6WPuCRh2UJTOe"
