      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "When this stone hits a creature or a hard surface, it explodes with a deafening bang. A thunderstone deals the listed sonic damage and sonic splash damage, and each creature within 10 feet of the space in which the stone exploded must succeed at a "
          },
          {
            "type": "check",
            "statistic": "save:fortitude",
            "dc": 20
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " saving throw with the listed DC or be "
          },
          {
            "type": "ref",
            "id": "4271da2e-7225-5aa7-9807-c499d8af6a5a"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " until the end of its next turn. Many types of thunderstone grant an item bonus to attack rolls."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "You gain a +1 item bonus to attack rolls. The bomb deals 2d4 sonic damage and 2 sonic splash damage, and the DC is 20."
          }
        ]
      }
